{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2012-meet-science2-45","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2012,"subject":"statistics","number":45,"points":2,"unitId":"statistics","unitLabel":"기초 생물통계학","topic":"기초 통계학","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["statistics"],"stem":"다음은 표본의 크기가 32인 자료에 대하여, X는 설명변수(독립\n변수)이고 Y는 반응변수(종속변수)인 단순선형회귀모형 \nYi=β0+β1Xi+i, i=1,⋯,32\n를 적용하여 얻은 분산분석표이다.\n요인\n자유도\n제곱합\n평균제곱\nF비\np값\ndfe\n―\n0.0103\n모형(회귀)\n1\n5\n5\n4\n20\n―\ndfe\n오차(잔차)\n20\ndfe\ndfe+1\n합계\n25\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? \n(단, 자료는 단순선형회귀모형에서 필요한 조건을 만족한다고 가정\n한다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 결정계수 R2은 0.25이다.\nㄴ. 오차(잔차)의 자유도 dfe는 30이다.\nㄷ. 유의수준 5%에서, 주어진 단순선형회귀모형이 유의하다고 \n할 수 있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t037"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t038"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t039"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t040"]}],"answer":4,"acceptedAnswers":[4],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":278,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[133.48,5.303,111.2,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t001"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-meet-science2-45/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":25,"height":23,"region":0,"bbox":[66.28,24.503,10.0,9.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-meet-science2-45/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":368,"height":33,"region":0,"bbox":[96.68,48.103,147.2,13.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-meet-science2-45/03.webp"},{"id":"fig